WEBVTT

00:06:59.957 --> 00:07:02.835
All this content is a reflection
of the actual content

00:07:02.877 --> 00:07:06.422
covered in the Ugandan educational
curriculum of mathematics,

00:07:06.464 --> 00:07:09.383
English, science and social studies.

00:07:09.842 --> 00:07:11.427
And as they interact,

00:07:11.469 --> 00:07:15.473
they get to earn points
for every trivia question they get right.

00:07:15.473 --> 00:07:19.560
And they use these points to advance
around the star-shaped board

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:22.104
with a goal of being the first one
to enter the middle

00:07:22.146 --> 00:07:24.356
and take on the big yellow star,

00:07:24.398 --> 00:07:26.609
which usually gets children very excited.

00:07:27.401 --> 00:07:30.654
My team and I also have worked together
to incorporate game mechanics